  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Arrhenious equation hold true for elementary as well as complex reactions.<br />Unit of A is same as unit of k. Rate of reaction is high if activation energy is low,<br />A and Ea are temperature independent.",
    "image": null
